# Snyk (https://snyk.io) policy file
version: v1.5.0
ignore:
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          No fix available through our build-time dependency chain. jackson-core is a transitive,
          build-time-only dependency of the org.jsonschema2dataclass Gradle plugin (used for JSON
          Schema -> POJO codegen in crime-commons-schemas/crime-commons-mod-schemas; not part of any
          published runtime jar). Fixed versions (2.18.6 / 2.21.1) require jsonschema2pojo-core
          1.3.0, which no released version of org.jsonschema2dataclass uses yet (latest, 6.1.0,
          pins jsonschema2pojo-core 1.2.2 -> jackson 2.17.2). Tracked in LASB-5312; re-evaluate
          once js2d-gradle ships a release built on jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15907551:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause as SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924 - build-time-only
          jackson-core dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass, no fix available until the plugin
          adopts jsonschema2pojo-core 1.3.0+. Tracked in LASB-5312.
        expires: 2026-11-21T00:00:00.000Z
        created: 2026-09-21T00:00:00.000Z
  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-18517159:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Same root cause as SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-15365924 - build-time-only
