  SNYK-JAVA-COMFASTERXMLJACKSONCORE-17440366:
    - '*':
        reason: >
          Critical - Incomplete List of Disallowed Inputs. Build-time-only jackson-databind
          dependency of org.jsonschema2dataclass (JSON Schema -> POJO codegen plugin, not part of
          any published runtime jar). Fixed versions (2.18.8 / 2.21.4) require jsonschema2pojo-core
          1.3.0, not yet used by any released org.jsonschema2dataclass version. Tracked in
          LASB-5312; re-evaluate once js2d-gradle ships a release built on jsonschema2pojo-core
